-- title:
--   Fresh observed-table schedules and native LWE row-kernel data
-- statement:
--   This package defines the complete loaded decision-to-search family, its public enumeration and source budgets, fresh-source kernels, candidate and verification schedules, and original-basis native LWE row/table loader data. It retains a supplied full observed sample pool, fresh complete tables for each scheduled trial, and the original native programs. Quantitative recovery success, uniform MQPT and source-table distribution guarantees are proved separately.
-- source:
--   Official Lean kernel/AST extraction of the existing proved sources recorded in /private/tmp/p2m_task4/loaded_batch_publication/bundles_minified/manifest.json. Current source SHA-256 6a4d546f72098e26066f37405442e8b2931e98ede6731191c48a759c4f58b303. The closed five-bundle environment passed 453 source API type and 319 safe data-value kernel-reflexivity checks, compiler flag/replacement checks, and the recursive standard-three-axiom audit of all 570 generated declaration origins. This bundle provides 168 of those source APIs; the exact original CI/provider map is attached in the local release receipt. Generated internal match/equation helpers are expanded for source API equality and audited for axioms rather than required to retain original compiler parameterization.

